alphabet -- elements of the base ring of a code
***********************************************

  * Usage: 
        alphabet(C)
  * Inputs:
      * C, an instance of the type *note LinearCode: LinearCode,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

Given a linear code C, the function returns the list of all elements of the
ring $R$, where $R$ is the ring containing the entries of the generator matrix
of C.

+-------------------------------------------+
|i1 : F=GF(4, Variable=>a);                 |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C=linearCode(matrix{{1,a,0},{0,1,a}});|
+-------------------------------------------+
|i3 : alphabet(C)                           |
|                                           |
|o3 = {0, a, a + 1, 1}                      |
|                                           |
|o3 : List                                  |
+-------------------------------------------+

