+---------------------------------------+
|i4 : length H                          |
|                                       |
|o4 = 7                                 |
+---------------------------------------+

The next example illustrates how to use this function for the class of
Evaluation Codes.

+--------------------------------+
|i5 : RM = reedMullerCode(2,3,1);|
+--------------------------------+
|i6 : length RM.LinearCode       |
|                                |
|o6 = 8                          |
+--------------------------------+

