+-------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : L = {{1,a,a+1},{a+1,1,a},{a,a+1,1},{1,0,1}};|
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : C = linearCode(F,L);                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : size C                                      |
|                                                 |
|o8 = 16                                          |
